|term[intermediate-location] :status settled :defined-by def-locations-and-paths :anchor path
  :word intermediate-location
  A non-terminal step of a path that is itself a [[term/location]].
  |invariants
    - Is a kind of [[term/location]]
    - Is a non-terminal step of one or more [[term/path]]
    - Owns routing its own next hop ([[term/progressive-routing]])
